// Moving Average Crossover
//
// Long while the fast average is above the slow one. The oldest published trend rule
// there is; the 50/200 pairing is the one the financial press calls a "golden cross".
//
// Included because it is the honest baseline: any strategy that cannot beat this, after
// costs and out of sample, is not earning its complexity.
strategy("MA Crossover", overlay = true)

fast = ema(close, 20)
slow = ema(close, 50)

plot(fast, title = "Fast", color = color.accent)
plot(slow, title = "Slow", color = color.mute)

if crossover(fast, slow)
    strategy.entry("trend", strategy.long)

if crossunder(fast, slow)
    strategy.close("trend")
